    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44128" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐθύ̆-ωρος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>in a straight
			direction</i>: mostly in neut. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐθύωρον</span> as Adv., 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐθύς, εὐ. ἄγειν</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				2.2.16
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				11.16
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁρᾶν</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				7.5
			</span></i>: as Adj., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐθύωρον τὴν ἀναχώρησιν ἐποιήσαντο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Anon.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				<u>EM</u>
				391.42
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Procop.
				<u>Aed.</u>
				2.2
			</span></i>.</div>
